<title>MEXICO: ICA 6-mos net profit falls.</title>
<headline>ICA 6-mos net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>6-mos 1997		   6-mos 1996</p>
<p>     Shr		  n.a.		     n.a.</p>
<p>     Net		  230.93 million	     452.20 million</p>
<p>     Revs		 3.783 bln		4.280 bln</p>
<p>     Gross profit     819.64 million	     648.45 million</p>
<p>     Oper profit	250.98 million	     200.94 million</p>
<p>     Integ fin gain   206.86 million	     739.43 million</p>
<p>	    Int paid    807.52 million	     n.a.</p>
<p>	    FX loss     43.68 million		n.a.</p>
<p>	    Int earned  699.96 million	     n.a.</p>
<p>	    Mon gain    358.10 million	     n.a.</p>
<p>	    NOTE: All figures in Mexican pesos.</p>
<p>	    Full company name is Empresas ICA SA.</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom, +525 728-9565))</p>
